e","shared_category_count":2},{"business_id":"_Bi9kN_eR75G1eqIl7S3pA","name":"The Bulldog","shared_categories":"Bars, Nightlife","shared_category_count":2},{"business_id":"TMBbCDQG6bENJoQSST0XiA","name":"Brigtsen's Restaurant","shared_categories":"","shared_category_count":0},{"business_id":"mhrW9O0O5hXGXGnEYBVoag","name":"Jacques-Imo's Cafe","shared_categories":"","shared_category_count":0},{"business_id":"8KnMSrMuTI2AtHZ2LOI8OQ","name":"Maurepas Foods","shared_categories":"","shared_category_count":0},{"business_id":"Zi-F-YvyVOK0k5QD7lrLOg","name":"Muriel's Jackson Square","shared_categories":"","shared_category_count":0},{"business_id":"pKykk7lnD6Tf9wSzJYRyJA","name":"Starbucks","shared_categories":"","shared_category_count":0}],"text":[{"business_id":"ta5Oi3sezvn4H299MbtE8Q","review_id":"jrcWho-1jXBlJcZOPDY9UQ","date":"2015-02-13T04:44:34","stars":5,"text_representativeness":0.9566393494606018,"text_excerpt":"Carousel Bar is a beautiful bar. I also love how the bar is slowly revolving. It's also a great break from crazy Bourbon Street when you're in the French Quarter. There may be a line to sit down at the actual carousel. (Or, you can troll people who look like they're almost done with their drinks until they get up and leave.) My friend and I high-fived when we finally saw a group leaving and snagged their seats! The cocktails menu was very appealing. The drinks available were very New Orleans-esque and the descriptions captivated me. They all sounded so delicious! I got Pimm's Cup and fell in love with it. It was refreshing and fruity. I could dangerously gulp down Pimm's Cup like nothing...."},{"business_id":"ta5Oi3sezvn4H299MbtE8Q","review_id":"aTOj_cnyPAoANVJ0bTlWVQ","date":"2018-12-02T02:40:43","stars":4,"text_representativeness":0.9559999704360962,"text_excerpt":"This was a really fun place. The bar is actually a carousel! How neat and unique is that. We got lucky and we got two seats at the bar right as we walked in. Sit down and watch as the room spins (slowly) around you. The cocktails were really good. I recommend trying at least one of their signature cocktails. We got to chat with quite a few people as we went round-and-round, which made it even more fun. Definitely make this a stop on your NOLA itinerary."},{"business_id":"ta5Oi3sezvn4H299MbtE8Q","review_id":"ooJ0q8B33LfzM0F-a9r09w","date":"2016-09-06T08:03:43","stars":4,"text_representativeness":0.9526959657669067,"text_excerpt":"This bar is sweet. While you usually need to pound several drinks before the bar starts spinning, the Carousel has a bar that *actually* spins, yes, like a Carousel. Dangerous! Magnificent! Dazzling! Kitschy! Weird! I'm into it! We grabbed a small (stationary) table near the whirling dervish and ordered some cocktails. I LOVED my Monteleone cocktail. I can't find the ingredients online, but it was refreshing after a long hot walk in the NOLA sun. Check this place out. You'll love it."}],"visual":[{"business_id":"ta5Oi3sezvn4H299MbtE8Q","photo_id":"0mIr9yiMPmaJTMVVrs57_w","label":"drink","image_url":"/photos/0mIr9yiMPmaJTMVVrs57_w.jpg","visual_representativeness":0.8850424289703369},{"business_id":"ta5Oi3sezvn4H299MbtE8Q","photo_id":"mk9up1xdejy_2saTiua5fg","label":"inside","image_url":"/photos/mk9up1xdejy_2saTiua5fg.jpg","visual_representativeness":0.8526937961578369},{"business_id":"ta5Oi3sezvn4H299MbtE8Q","photo_id":"v6tEvWTpmbnNifsUFi0LOw","label":"food","image_url":"/photos/v6tEvWTpmbnNifsUFi0LOw.jpg","visual_representativeness":0.8429878354072571},{"business_id":"ta5Oi3sezvn4H299MbtE8Q","photo_id":"4xzhUDHe8pjQqPVoPJJpLw","label":"inside","image_url":"/photos/4xzhUDHe8pjQqPVoPJJpLw.jpg","visual_representativeness":0.8016406893730164},{"business_id":"ta5Oi3sezvn4H299MbtE8Q","photo_id":"qREm4vDPmHhyqboGtGfdbw","label":"outside","image_url":"/photos/qREm4vDPmHhyqboGtGfdbw.jpg","visual_representativeness":0.7678452134132385}]},"notebook_case":null}
